<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>New Publication Notification</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #f4f7f6;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 20px auto;
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 12px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        .header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6c5ce7, #a29bfe);
            color: #ffffff;
            padding: 30px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .header h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        .content {
            padding: 30px;
        }
        .info-card {
            background: #f9f9f9;
            border-left: 4px solid #6c5ce7;
            padding: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }
        .info-row {
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
        }
        .info-label {
            font-weight: 700;
            width: 120px;
            color: #666;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }
        .info-value {
            flex: 1;
            color: #2d3436;
            font-weight: 500;
        }
        .footer {
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            color: #999;
            background: #f4f7f6;
        }
        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 12px 25px;
            background-color: #6c5ce7;
            color: #ffffff !important;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 30px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-top: 20px;
            transition: background 0.3s;
        }
        .btn:hover {
            background-color: #5b4bc4;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>a new publication send</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <p>A new publication has been posted on the platform. Here are the details:</p>
            
            <div class="info-card">
                <div class="info-row">
                    <span class="info-label">Title:</span>
                    <span class="info-value">{{ publication.titrePub }}</span>
                </div>
                <div class="info-row">
                    <span class="info-label">Author:</span>
                    <span class="info-value">{{ publication.user.firstName }} {{ publication.user.lastName }}</span>
                </div>
                <div class="info-row">
                    <span class="info-label">Category:</span>
                    <span class="info-value">{{ publication.categoriePub }}</span>
                </div>
                <div class="info-row">
                    <span class="info-label">Date:</span>
                    <span class="info-value">{{ publication.dateCreationPub|date('Y-m-d H:i') }}</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <p>You can view the full discussion by clicking the button below:</p>
            <div style="text-align: center;">
                <a href="{{ url('frontend_forum') }}" class="btn">Go to Forum</a>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            &copy; {{ "now"|date("Y") }} Horizon Platform. All rights reserved.
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
